# Initial Enumeration

A password reset request was initiated for the attacker's account.

The application generated a temporary password reset URL similar to:

```text
/forgot-password?temp-forgot-password-token=h6hwi2q9mlzcc1e7vdt9p15mblu3f1r9
```

The reset token was delivered via email.

