# Captured Password Reset Request

After submitting a new password, Burp Suite captured the following request:

```http
POST /forgot-password?temp-forgot-password-token=h6hwi2q9mlzcc1e7vdt9p15mblu3f1r9 HTTP/2
Host: LAB-ID.web-security-academy.net

temp-forgot-password-token=h6hwi2q9mlzcc1e7vdt9p15mblu3f1r9
&username=wiener
&new-password-1=password
